          "block_content": "By far the most reported Internet-related offense is Internet auction fraud.According to the Internet FraudComplaintCenter, Internet auction fraud comprisedover46 percentofreferred fraudcomplaints in2002,nearly 8 percent more than the previous year. Nondelivery and payment comprised 31percentofcomplaints and credit/debit card fraud were nearly12 percent.(Source:IFCC2002InternetFraudReport)\nConnect Visit the Web site for the Federal TradeCommission or related government site andfindoutwhat is beingdone to combat Internet auction fraud.\n",
